. Alternative splicing results in multiple transcript variants. [provided by RefSeq, Oct 2016].","ncbi_source":"NCBI Gene summary (RefSeq), via MyGene.info","uniprot_function":[{"accession":"Q9P2W9","text":"Syntaxin that may be involved in targeting and fusion of Golgi-derived retrograde transport vesicles with the ER."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}